ity#{6}":[54,54]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Ragnar Longships","Dragon Prows","Eastern Ridge","Chain Flail","Sub-Cellar","Throat Cut","Drainage Pipe","Blood Vigil","Claymore Manor"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**What is this?** A critical mission log detailing the rescue of Alec Hamilton from Valheim Monastery. It marks the first kill for Ryan and establishes a permanent rift with Loren Claymore.\\n\\n**When should it be selected?** Select during the \\\"Blood Vigil\\\" arc phase leading to the June 1843 timeline, specifically when the group is planning the monastery infiltration or facing the consequences of the confrontation.\\n\\n**Key relationships:** Establishes Ryan’s first kill and permanently scars the group; confirms Loren orchestrated the rescue as bait to capture Ryan; cements Estra's loyalty through shared violence.\\\""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 010] - The Valheim Monastery Extraction.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"9vmxmh","at":1777331817923},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 010] - The Valheim Monastery Extraction.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":896,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
