Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity":[48,54],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{1}":[49,49],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{2}":[50,50],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{3}":[51,51],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{4}":[52,52],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{5}":[53,53],"#The Valheim Monastery Extraction#Outcome & Continuity#{6}":[54,54]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Ragnar Longships","Dragon Prows","Eastern Ridge","Chain Flail","Sub-Cellar","Throat Cut","Drainage Pipe","Blood Vigil","Claymore Manor"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"**What is this?** A critical mission log detailing the rescue of Alec Hamilton from Valheim Monastery. It marks the first kill for Ryan and establishes a permanent rift with Loren Claymore.\\n\\n**When should it be selected?** Select during the \\\"Blood Vigil\\\" arc phase leading to the June 1843 timeline, specifically when the group is planning the monastery infiltration or facing the consequences of the confrontation.\\n\\n**Key relationships:** Establishes Ryan’s first kill and permanently scars the group; confirms Loren orchestrated the rescue as bait to capture Ryan; cements Estra's loyalty through shared violence.\\\""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 010] - The Valheim Monastery Extraction.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"9vmxmh","at":1777331883903},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.03433686,0.01381163,-0.01163072,0.01842005,-0.00544116,-0.03078763,-0.01674647,-0.00816542,0.04727917,0.00976093,-0.01333201,-0.02159089,0.00453653,0.03464678,0.01293037,0.07921949,-0.00522096,0.05361498,-0.09285245,0.02144494,0.03145745,-0.03222718,0.04517586,-0.00784747,0.04223087,0.01192216,-0.0094148,-0.02148098,-0.01629604,-0.18381765